  "fullDescription": "Midnight navy floral damask pattern bursting with cobalt blooms, turquoise butterflies, and golden bows on a deep dark background.\n\nThis richly layered surface pattern features large cobalt blue and royal blue open flowers as the primary motifs, their petals rendered with fine white stamen detail. Swirling baroque-style acanthus scroll vines in deep violet and indigo weave throughout the composition, connecting clusters of smaller daisy-like blooms, teal and turquoise bell-shaped flowers, and delicate forget-me-nots. Whimsical tan and gold polka-dot ribbon bows appear at intervals alongside illustrated turquoise butterflies, giving the design a feminine, storybook charm. Strawberry silhouettes in muted bronze tones and blueberry clusters add a cottagecore botanical layer to the overall composition.\n\nThe colour story is dramatic and jewel-toned: near-black navy forms the backdrop while cobalt blue, cerulean, electric turquoise, periwinkle, and lavender-purple create a luminous floral cascade. Warm tan and antique gold accents from the bows and strawberries provide contrast against the cool blue palette, preventing the design from feeling monotone. The mood is enchanting, romantic, and slightly vintage — evoking Victorian botanical illustration crossed with folk art maximalism.\n\nIdeal for fabric yardage, quilting cotton, apparel sublimation, gift wrap, wallpaper, Spoonflower uploads, Redbubble POD products, scrapbooking paper, journal covers, phone cases, tote bag prints, Canva backgrounds, Procreate pattern swatches, and Photoshop textile mockups. Perfect for wedding stationery, birthday wrapping, nursery decor, and feminine branding projects.",
